{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2023-03-16 11:00:00', 'title': 'FORD PRO WORKING WITH ERNST & YOUNG LLP TO HELP CUSTOMERS UNDERSTAND ELECTRIC VEHICLE TAX CREDITS', 'text': "DEARBORN, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORD PRO™ IS EXPANDING ITS ONE-STOP SHOP FOR COMMERCIAL CUSTOMERS WITH THE ANNOUNCEMENT OF A NEW PROGRAM DESIGNED TO HELP FLEETS UNDERSTAND INFLATION REDUCTION ACT (IRA) ELECTRIC VEHICLE TAX CREDITS. FORD'S COMMERCIAL DIVISION IS WORKING WITH PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FIRM ERNST & YOUNG LLP (EY US) TO HELP PROVIDE CUSTOMERS WITH INFORMATION ON POTENTIALLY VALUABLE TAX CREDITS AND INCENTIVES DESIGNED TO MAKE ELECTRIC VEHICLE ADOPTION MORE AFFORDABLE."}